\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. We know, by faith we surely know,
\par The Son of God is come,
\par Is manifested here below,
\par And makes our hearts His home:
\par To us He hath, in gracious love,
\par An understanding given,
\par To recognize Him from above
\par The Lord of earth and heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The self-existing God supreme,
\par Our Saviour we adore,
\par Fountain of life eternal Him
\par We worship evermore:
\par Out of His plenitude receive
\par Ineffable delight,
\par And shall through endless ages live
\par Triumphant in His sight.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

